---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout current="essays" title="随记">
<main class="w-full pt-20 bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-14rem)]" id="main">
<div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- Subtle Grain & Ambient Glow Canvas -->
<div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden pb-space-xl">
<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-20 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/30 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-24 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<!-- Editorial Header Banner -->
<section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter pt-space-lg mb-space-xl">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-lg pb-space-lg">
<div class="flex flex-col max-w-2xl">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-secondary mb-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-semibold">Folio Volume 04</span>
<span class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant/40">/</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Archived Thoughts &amp; Ephemera</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-display text-primary tracking-tight font-normal leading-none mb-space-sm text-display-mobile sm:text-display">
                  漫步随记
                  <span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md italic text-on-surface-variant font-light ml-space-xs">Writings &amp; Ephemera</span>
</h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl">
                  不设限的网文追更札记、酷狗歌单沉迷、二次元动漫与大学日常琐碎。记录穿梭在虚拟世界与现实操场晚风里的微小共鸣与精神避难所。
                </p>
</div>
<!-- Filter Pill Group -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-xs bg-surface-container-low p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm">
<button class="filter-tab active px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md bg-primary-container text-on-primary shadow-sm transition-all" data-target="all" type="button">
                  全部随笔
                  <span class="ml-1 opacity-70 font-label-sm text-[0.625rem]">48</span></button><button class="filter-tab px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container transition-all" data-target="essay" type="button">
                  网文与动漫
                  <span class="ml-1 opacity-70 font-label-sm text-[0.625rem]">21</span></button><button class="filter-tab px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container transition-all" data-target="micro" type="button">
                  碎碎念
                  <span class="ml-1 opacity-70 font-label-sm text-[0.625rem]">19</span></button><button class="filter-tab px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container transition-all" data-target="excerpt" type="button">
                  台词摘录
                  <span class="ml-1 opacity-70 font-label-sm text-[0.625rem]">8</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Main Content Asymmetric 12-Column Grid -->
<div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start">
<div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-8" id="essays">
<article class="group relative bg-surface-container-low/70 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-10 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md hover:bg-surface-container-low" data-target="essay">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-space-md mb-2">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-md text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="text-secondary font-medium tracking-wide">网文随笔</span><span class="text-outline-variant text-xs">·</span><span class="">2024年12月20日</span><span class="text-outline-variant text-xs">·</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">schedule</span>
                        8分钟阅读</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-xs text-on-surface-variant/60 tracking-wider font-mono">#052</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight font-normal mb-3 group-hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">
<a class="hover:underline decoration-on-tertiary-container decoration-1 underline-offset-4" href="/essays/lord-of-mysteries/">《追完〈诡秘之主〉：当代网文的叙事宿命感》</a>
</h2>
<div class="mb-4 p-5 bg-surface-container/60 rounded-lg pl-6 border-l-2 border-secondary/40 flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<p class="font-quote text-quote italic text-primary leading-relaxed">
                      “我们是守夜人，也是一群时刻对抗着疯狂与失控的可怜虫。照亮黑夜的，往往正是甘愿燃烧自我的普通灵魂。”
                    </p>
</div>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-5">
                    熬夜读完克莱恩在灰雾之上的最终谢幕，窗外校园的天色已经微微泛白。当代优秀的网络文学早已脱离了单纯的升级爽快感，构建起如工业维多利亚与神话克苏鲁交织的庞大宇宙。那种面对不可名状世界依然坚守人性的悲悯与秩序，恰恰击中了在焦虑现实中疲惫摸索的年轻灵魂。
                  </p>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-space-md pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm flex-wrap text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-xs">
<span class="hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer">#诡秘之主</span><span class="hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer">#网文漫谈</span><span class="hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer">#宿命感</span>
</div>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-medium hover:text-on-tertiary-container transition-colors group/link" href="/essays/lord-of-mysteries/"><span class="">阅读全文</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base transition-transform group-hover/link:translate-x-1">arrow_forward</span></a>
</div>
</article>
<article class="group relative bg-surface-container-low/70 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-10 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md hover:bg-surface-container-low" data-target="micro">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-space-md mb-2">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-md text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="text-secondary font-medium tracking-wide">音乐与散步</span><span class="text-outline-variant text-xs">·</span><span class="">2024年11月15日</span><span class="text-outline-variant text-xs">·</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">schedule</span>
                        6分钟阅读</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-xs text-on-surface-variant/60 tracking-wider font-mono">#051</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight font-normal mb-3 group-hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">
<a class="hover:underline decoration-on-tertiary-container decoration-1 underline-offset-4" href="/essays/campus-walk-playlist/">《戴着耳机用酷狗听老歌，在大学操场漫步》</a>
</h2>
<div class="mb-5 p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container/70 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-5">
<div class="relative w-16 h-16 shrink-0 bg-primary-container rounded shadow-sm overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center">
<div class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center">
<div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-w-0 w-full">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
<span class="font-label-sm text-xs text-secondary font-medium tracking-wider">酷狗播放中 · 单曲循环</span><span class="font-mono text-xs text-on-surface-variant/70">无损音质 · 2000s</span>
</div>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary truncate leading-snug">
                        周杰伦 · 晴天 (Jay Chou)
                      </h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant truncate">
                        “刮风这天，我试过握着你手，但偏偏雨渐渐……”
                      </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-space-md pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm flex-wrap text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-xs">
<span class="hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer">#周杰伦</span><span class="hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer">#操场夜走</span><span class="hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer">#老歌回声</span>
</div>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-medium hover:text-on-tertiary-container transition-colors group/link" href="/essays/campus-walk-playlist/"><span class="">阅读全文</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base transition-transform group-hover/link:translate-x-1">arrow_forward</span></a>
</div>
</article>
<p class="hidden rounded-xl border border-dashed border-outline-variant p-8 text-center font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant" id="essays-empty">这一类的文字还在整理中，先去翻翻别的吧。</p></div>
